{"id":"636621","name":"炒米粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636621/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄豆芽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好干米粉。","img":"images/636621/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧水，水开后，下入米粉煮熟(转中小火)。","img":"images/636621/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮好的米粉，泡10分钟左右。","img":"images/636621/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净，多洗几遍。","img":"images/636621/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入一个大碗中，加油、盐、鸡精、蚝油、生抽、老抽。","img":"images/636621/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻拌均匀，待用。","img":"images/636621/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅烧油(少许油)，下入肥肉煸出油，再下入瘦肉翻炒变色。","img":"images/636621/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下入黄豆芽，翻炒断生。","img":"images/636621/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入米粉，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636621/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"下入辣椒，翻炒均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/636621/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅装盘。","img":"images/636621/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636621/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}